17:53:37 | ROUTE       {"message": "What services does SunCedar Energy offer?", "intent": "general_question", "confidence": 0.99, "reason": "Asks about services covered in business overview"}
17:53:41 | REFLECTION  {"verdict": "approved", "issues": [], "draft": "We design, install and maintain solar and battery systems for homes and small businesses in Lebanon.\n\nOur services include:\n- Free Energy Audit: a 60-minute on-site assessment with a written proposal within 48 hours\n- Home solar packages: Essential, Comfort and Premium\n- Business solar systems: custom systems from 10 to 100 kWp\n- Battery Retrofits: adding LiFePO4 battery storage to an existing solar system, subject to compatibility\n- CareShield maintenance: cleaning, health checks, remote monitoring and priority repairs\n- SunPulse app: live monitoring, outage alerts and monthly savings reports\n\nWe do not install solar water heaters or EV chargers, and we do not sell equipment without installation. If you’d like, we can also help you choose which package fits your home or business with a free energy audit.", "revised": null}
17:53:41 | REPLY       {"intent": "general_question", "tools": [], "reply": "We design, install and maintain solar and battery systems for homes and small businesses in Lebanon.\n\nOur services include:\n- Free Energy Audit: a 60-minute on-site assessment with a written proposal within 48 hours\n- Home solar packages: Essential, Comfort and Premium\n- Business solar systems: custom systems from 10 to 100 kWp\n- Battery Retrofits: adding LiFePO4 battery storage to an existing solar system, subject to compatibility\n- CareShield maintenance: cleaning, health checks, remote monitoring and priority repairs\n- SunPulse app: live monitoring, outage alerts and monthly savings reports\n\nWe do not install solar water heaters or EV chargers, and we do not sell equipment without installation. If you’d like, we can also help you choose which package fits your home or business with a free energy audit."}
