17:53:56 | REFLECTION  {"verdict": "approved", "issues": [], "draft": "Great choice — our Premium package is 8 kWp of solar panels, a 15 kWh LiFePO4 battery, and a 10 kW hybrid inverter, priced at $9,800 including installation, the SunPulse app, and the first year of maintenance.\n\nTo get started, we begin with a free 60-minute Energy Audit at your villa. We assess your electricity use, check the roof and shading, and then send you a tailored written proposal within 48 hours. For home systems, the usual timeline from audit to switch-on is 7 to 14 days.\n\nTo arrange that, may I have your full name and email address? If you like, you can also add a short note such as your area in Mount Lebanon or any specific power needs.", "revised": null}
