17:54:21 | REFLECTION  {"verdict": "approved", "issues": [], "draft": "Our Comfort package is **$6,500** and includes **5 kWp** of solar panels, a **10 kWh LiFePO4 battery**, and an **8 kW hybrid inverter**. In simple terms, **kWp** is the panel system’s peak power, and **kWh** is how much energy the battery can store.\n\nIt’s designed for families and can typically cover **lights, fridge, internet, TV, laptops, plus a washing machine, water pump, and one AC unit during the day**. The price includes **installation, SunPulse app setup, and the first year of maintenance**.\n\nA few helpful extras:\n- **Expandable later** if you want to add panels or batteries\n- **12-month interest-free installments** available through Cedar Community Bank, subject to approval\n- Warranties: **25 years on panel performance, 10 years on inverter, 10 years or 6,000 cycles on the battery, and 5 years on workmanship**\n\nIf you’d like, we can help you book the **free 60-minute energy audit** to confirm whether Comfort is the right fit for your home.", "revised": null}
