17:55:53 | REFLECTION  {"verdict": "approved", "issues": [], "draft": "We design, install and maintain solar and battery systems for homes and small businesses in Lebanon.\n\nOur services include:\n- Free Energy Audit: a 60-minute on-site assessment with a written proposal within 48 hours\n- Home solar packages: Essential, Comfort and Premium\n- Business solar systems: custom systems from 10 to 100 kWp\n- Battery Retrofits: adding LiFePO4 battery storage to existing solar systems, subject to compatibility\n- CareShield maintenance plan: cleanings, health checks, remote monitoring and priority repairs\n- SunPulse monitoring app: live production, battery status, alerts and savings reports\n\nWe do not currently install solar water heaters or EV chargers. If you’d like, I can also walk you through the home packages and pricing.", "revised": null}
17:55:53 | REPLY       {"intent": "general_question", "tools": [], "reply": "We design, install and maintain solar and battery systems for homes and small businesses in Lebanon.\n\nOur services include:\n- Free Energy Audit: a 60-minute on-site assessment with a written proposal within 48 hours\n- Home solar packages: Essential, Comfort and Premium\n- Business solar systems: custom systems from 10 to 100 kWp\n- Battery Retrofits: adding LiFePO4 battery storage to existing solar systems, subject to compatibility\n- CareShield maintenance plan: cleanings, health checks, remote monitoring and priority repairs\n- SunPulse monitoring app: live production, battery status, alerts and savings reports\n\nWe do not currently install solar water heaters or EV chargers. If you’d like, I can also walk you through the home packages and pricing."}
